@TradingApp_HostAddress = https://localhost:7065

### Register (default role: Viewer)
POST {{TradingApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "trader@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePass123!",
  "firstName": "Max",
  "lastName": "Mustermann"
}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{TradingApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@tradingapp.local",
  "password": "Admin123!ChangeMe"
}

### Current user
GET {{TradingApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Refresh tokens
POST {{TradingApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}

### Revoke refresh token (logout)
POST {{TradingApp_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/revoke
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{login.response.body.refreshToken}}"
}
